 on the  support of her director and castmates to  help her get through some of the most  adult situations  for her oscar-nominated turn in the  harrowing movie cake  jennifer aniston had to face one of her  biggest fears  going underwater see when jen was only  five years old  she accidentally drove her tricycle into  her family pool and sunk  all the way to the bottom after that the  idea of being submerged in water became  her biggest fear  and it took her over 30 takes to work up  the courage to let herself sink  underwater on set  who was the most freaked out about  having to shoot that scene matt damon  matt damon has played all kinds of  action heroes  but it turns out that his biggest fear  in the world is snakes  maybe he should give indiana jones a try  i  hate snake shark i hate him scarlett  johansson revealed that while filming  their heartwarming film we bought a zoo  damon actually cried a little bit when  faced with the idea of handling the  slithery creatures  but because the kids in the film and  skarjo insisted he wound up working with  the snakes and facing his biggest fear  my legs didn't work i was just like  even though she gave matt damon a hard  time for being afraid of snakes  scarlett johansson has a funny animal  phobia of her own  birds the actress has said that she  really doesn't like their  beaks and wings and the way that they  move really creep her out  but in we bought a zoo she had to  overcome her phobia to film scenes  around lots of birds  the ones that she refused to go near  however peacocks  so fun working with animals scarlett  isn't the only celeb with an aversion to  the big winged creatures either  even though jake gyllenhaal didn't go  into prince of persia with a fear of  ostriches  by the time he left it was a full-on  phobia  ostrich racing the handlers reminded him  one too many times not to make noise  near the big birds  because they could tear out your eyes  and rip out your heart  so when it came time to film the scene  where he is chased by a pack of them  the fear in his eyes was all real  for someone who was starred in movies  like charlie and the chocolate factory  and alice in wonderland  it seems odd that johnny depp would be  afraid of clowns  but he is the actor had to face his fear  while filming both charlie and the  chocolate factory and alice in  wonderland  how does he deal with his fear in the  most johnny depp way possible  by surrounding himself with clown  paraphernalia to ward off the evil  why not you know what if these celebs  can face their biggest fears  like shailene woodley climbing to the  very top of a ferris wheel  it makes us feel like we can do the same  though  you know maybe tomorrow  but we want to know what is your biggest  fear that you would face for your dream  [Music]  job

